---
description: PHP library rules
globs:
  - "src/**/*.php"
alwaysApply: false
---

Target PHP >=8.2 (<8.6). The only runtime dependency besides PHP extensions is `symfony/translation-contracts`; do not add a framework dependency.

Prefer:
- modern PHP with strict typing and explicit return types
- PSR-12 coding style
- final readonly classes for value objects
- validation in constructors (fail fast, never a half-built object)
- no I/O in value objects
- PHPDoc in English for every class and public method

This package is a contract with a 1.x lifetime of years: never break a public signature, constant or property.
Do not add PHPDoc in Spanish.
Do not touch unrelated namespaces or files.
